Description: Custom Discord client with Vencord modifications (upstream binary repack)
 A custom Discord desktop app built on top of Vencord, providing
 client-side modifications, a built-in plugin system, and improved
 Wayland/Linux support over the official Discord client.
 .
 This package repackages the upstream pre-built binary release.
